> When you die the game shows you your attributes (you were lucky, saw
> invisible, etc) and, eventually, a ladder of all your dead characters.
> Is it possible to see your attributes and/or your past characters
> without dying?

nethack -s[n] [-v]

-s shows you all for the current version of the game.  -sn shows you
the scores in the top n for the current version of the game.  Adding
the -v shows scores for all versions of the game in your record file
(if you've brought your record over from prior versions).

